{
  "_note": "今日总览：最多 6 件事，每行 图标 / 名字 / 今天达没达标 / 连续天数，各带自己的主题色。零入参。\n⚠️ `pal` 这个键在循环里被反复覆盖 —— 它只是 `_sel` 的临时输入，每行紧接着就把结果存进 m<i>，覆盖不会串（op:set 是顺序求值）。不要把它放进 resultFilter。",
  "version": 1,
  "actions": [
    {
      "_note": "入参先落地成 data 域的键(§9.5 #3),再由 resultFilter 透出去 —— **RCN 只看得见 flow 的输出**,shell params 不进渲染域。`mask` 决定卡上打不打码(打码开关在事项页,经 pickWidgets 的 per-item params 传进来)。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "mask",
        "value": "${mask}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "多事项总览：读清单 + 每件事的 stat，按固定下标摊开（上限 6 行）。",
      "id": "it",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "items",
        "default": []
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nowMs",
        "value": "${@time.nowMs}"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "按自然日归零再相减，否则同一天的上午/下午会算出不同天数（同 moment/countdown.df）。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayMs",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "todayKey",
        "value": "$[formatDate::(${nowMs},yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n0",
        "value": "${it[0].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q0",
        "value": "stat_${it[0].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n1",
        "value": "${it[1].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q1",
        "value": "stat_${it[1].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n2",
        "value": "${it[2].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q2",
        "value": "stat_${it[2].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n3",
        "value": "${it[3].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q3",
        "value": "stat_${it[3].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n4",
        "value": "${it[4].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q4",
        "value": "stat_${it[4].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "n5",
        "value": "${it[5].name}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "q5",
        "value": "stat_${it[5].id}"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s0",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q0}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s1",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q1}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q2}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q3}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q4}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "action": "data.get",
      "params": {
        "key": "${q5}",
        "default": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "槽位有没有事项。空字符串判定用哨兵串 `_`：findNotEmpty 取不到就返回 `_`，再与 `_` 比。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${n0},_),_),0,1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "i0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${it[0].icon},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pal",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${it[0].pal},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "m0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${pal},1),#2E9E6B|#45C793,if::(eq::(${pal},2),#2F6FE4|#5C9BFF,if::(eq::(${pal},3),#7A5AF8|#A78BFA,if::(eq::(${pal},4),#E07B39|#F0A05F,if::(eq::(${pal},5),#D2536D|#E87A93,#0E9AA7|#35C2CE)))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "gr0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${it[0].goal},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "g0",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${gr0},1),${gr0},1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "b0",
        "value": "${s0.byDay}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(get::(${b0},${todayKey}),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "_note": "达标 = 今天次数 ≥ 该事项的每日目标（不是 >0）。",
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "d0",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${v0},${g0}),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "z0",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(${s0.lastTs},yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "a0",
        "value": "$[if::(ge::(${z0},calc::(${todayMs}-86400000)),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "u0",
        "value": "$[parseDate::(formatDate::(findNotEmpty::(${s0.streakEnd},${s0.lastTs}),yyyy-MM-dd),yyyy-MM-dd)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "t0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${a0},1),calc::(round::(calc::((${u0}-${s0.streakStart})/86400000),0)+1),0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "w0",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${it[0].id},)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "h1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${n1},_),_),0,1)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
